---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="DTP — AI Readiness Command Centre"
  description="Digital Technology Partner helps leadership teams understand AI adoption, choose what to build, and deliver focused proofs, MVPs and pilots."
>
  <Header />
  <main class="concept command-centre">
    <section class="ma-hero concept-hero">
      <div class="gradient-mesh-bg hero-mesh"></div>
      <div class="ma-hero-grid-bg"></div>
      <div class="ma-hero-scan"></div>
      <div class="ma-container hero-layout">
        <div class="hero-copy">
          <span class="ma-section-tag">// ai_readiness.command_centre</span>
          <h1>Know where AI can help before you start building.</h1>
          <p class="ma-hero-sub">DTP gives leadership teams a clear view of AI adoption inside the business, then turns the strongest opportunities into focused proof of concept, MVP and pilot work.</p>
          <div class="ma-hero-actions">
            <a class="ma-btn ma-btn-mint" href="https://outlook.office.com/bookwithme/user/f0762b9af6a94ed2add9818a4f3ca4e5@digitaltechnologypartner.ai/meetingtype/qc2lOXjEdkO6GkMS_jZJrQ2?anonymous" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Book a Discovery Call</a>
            <a class="ma-btn ma-btn-outline" href="#route">See the route →</a>
          </div>
          <div class="proof-strip">
            <div class="proof-pill"><em>01</em><span>Readiness first</span></div>
            <div class="proof-pill"><em>05</em><span>Decision gates</span></div>
            <div class="proof-pill"><em>00</em><span>Blind builds</span></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <aside class="command-panel" aria-label="AI readiness command centre illustration">
          <div class="panel-top"><span>readiness.scan / leadership</span><i></i></div>
          <div class="signal-grid">
            <div class="signal"><b>Use cases</b><span><em style="width:76%"></em></span><strong>mapped</strong></div>
            <div class="signal"><b>Risk</b><span><em style="width:48%"></em></span><strong>visible</strong></div>
            <div class="signal"><b>Capability</b><span><em style="width:61%"></em></span><strong>uneven</strong></div>
            <div class="signal"><b>Data</b><span><em style="width:39%"></em></span><strong>patchy</strong></div>
          </div>
          <div class="decision-card"><small>recommended next decision</small><strong>Encourage, control, investigate, stop, or prove.</strong></div>
        </aside>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="ma-section" id="route">
      <div class="ma-container">
        <div class="ma-section-header wide"><span class="ma-section-tag">// from_visibility_to_value</span><h2>AI adoption is already happening. Leadership needs the operating picture.</h2><p>Most organisations do not need another generic AI promise. They need to know where value, risk, capability and appetite actually sit before committing time and money to the next build.</p></div>
        <div class="ma-benefits-grid readiness-grid">
          <article class="ma-benefit-card primary"><div class="ma-card-line"></div><span class="card-index">01</span><h3>Readiness Snapshot</h3><p>A low-friction signal check for where the AI questions are forming and whether a deeper diagnostic is justified.</p></article>
          <article class="ma-benefit-card"><div class="ma-card-line"></div><span class="card-index">02</span><h3>Readiness Diagnostic</h3><p>An evidence base leadership can trust before deciding what to encourage, control, investigate or stop.</p></article>
          <article class="ma-benefit-card"><div class="ma-card-line"></div><span class="card-index">03</span><h3>Readiness Advisory</h3><p>Human interpretation, challenge and leadership playback — not a dashboard dropped into someone’s inbox.</p></article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="ma-section section-alt">
      <div class="ma-container split-section">
        <div><span class="ma-section-tag">// still_building</span><h2>We still build. We just refuse to build blindly.</h2><p>When the opportunity is strong enough, DTP can design and build the proof, MVP, pilot or operational workflow. The difference is that the build is tied to evidence, ownership and a real decision.</p></div>
        <div class="proof-stack">
          <div class="proof-item"><b>01</b><h3>Opportunity framing</h3><p>What problem is actually worth solving?</p></div>
          <div class="proof-item"><b>02</b><h3>Proof of concept</h3><p>Can it work against real constraints?</p></div>
          <div class="proof-item"><b>03</b><h3>MVP or pilot</h3><p>Can people use it and does it change the work?</p></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="ma-section">
      <div class="ma-container">
        <div class="ma-section-header"><span class="ma-section-tag">// decision_flow</span><h2>A route from uncertainty to operational proof.</h2></div>
        <div class="flow-strip">
          <div><span>01</span><strong>Map</strong><p>Current AI use, pressure points and business questions.</p></div>
          <div><span>02</span><strong>Diagnose</strong><p>Capability, data, risk, value and readiness.</p></div>
          <div><span>03</span><strong>Decide</strong><p>Encourage, control, investigate, stop or prove.</p></div>
          <div><span>04</span><strong>Build</strong><p>Focused PoC, MVP, pilot or workflow.</p></div>
          <div><span>05</span><strong>Operate</strong><p>Adoption, ownership and evidence loop.</p></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="ma-cta"><div class="ma-container ma-cta-inner"><h2>Want a clearer view of AI inside your business?</h2><p>Start with a conversation about where leadership needs evidence, not another tool demo.</p><a class="ma-btn ma-btn-mint ma-btn-lg" href="https://outlook.office.com/bookwithme/user/f0762b9af6a94ed2add9818a4f3ca4e5@digitaltechnologypartner.ai/meetingtype/qc2lOXjEdkO6GkMS_jZJrQ2?anonymous" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Book a Discovery Call</a></div></section>
  </main>
</Layout>

<style>
  .concept-hero {
    padding: 10.5rem 0 4.5rem;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .hero-mesh { position: absolute; inset: 0; filter: blur(70px); opacity: .95; }
  .hero-layout {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr .9fr;
    gap: 4rem;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .hero-copy h1 {
    font-size: clamp(3.4rem, 7.4vw, 6.8rem);
    line-height: .92;
    letter-spacing: -.06em;
    max-width: 760px;
  }
  .wide { max-width: 860px; }
  .wide p { font-size: 1.08rem; max-width: 720px; color: rgba(255,255,255,.82); }

  /* Proof strip */
  .proof-strip { display: flex; gap: .65rem; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-top: 2rem; }
  .proof-pill {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: .6rem;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,.06);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.13);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: .48rem .9rem;
  }
  .proof-pill em {
    font-family: var(--ma-font-mono);
    color: var(--ma-mint);
    font-style: normal;
    font-size: .74rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    min-width: 1.5em;
  }
  .proof-pill span { font-size: .82rem; color: rgba(255,255,255,.65); white-space: nowrap; }

  /* Command panel */
  .command-panel {
    background: linear-gradient(145deg, rgba(26,26,46,.92), rgba(17,17,34,.94));
    border: 1px solid var(--ma-border);
    border-radius: 20px;
    padding: 1.5rem;
    box-shadow: 0 28px 90px rgba(0,0,0,.42), 0 0 0 1px rgba(0,229,160,.06) inset;
  }
  .panel-top {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    font-family: var(--ma-font-mono);
    font-size: .78rem;
    color: var(--ma-text-dim);
    margin-bottom: 1.3rem;
  }
  .panel-top i { width: 10px; height: 10px; background: var(--ma-mint); border-radius: 50%; box-shadow: 0 0 18px var(--ma-mint); }
  .signal-grid { display: grid; gap: .85rem; }
  .signal {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 92px 1fr 82px;
    align-items: center;
    gap: .8rem;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,.04);
    border: 1px solid var(--ma-border);
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: .85rem;
  }
  .signal b, .signal strong { font-size: .78rem; }
  .signal b { color: rgba(255,255,255,.82); }
  .signal strong { color: var(--ma-white); text-align: right; }
  .signal span { height: 8px; background: #25283d; border-radius: 99px; overflow: hidden; }
  .signal em { display: block; height: 100%; background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--ma-mint), rgba(0,229,160,.12)); }
  .decision-card {
    margin-top: 1rem;
    border: 1px solid rgba(0,229,160,.28);
    background: var(--ma-mint-dim);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 1rem 1.2rem;
  }
  .decision-card small { display: block; font-family: var(--ma-font-mono); color: var(--ma-mint); margin-bottom: .4rem; }
  .decision-card strong { font-family: var(--ma-font-display); font-size: 1.3rem; color: var(--ma-white); }

  /* Readiness cards */
  .card-index { font-family: var(--ma-font-mono); color: var(--ma-mint); font-size: .78rem; display: block; margin-bottom: .5rem; }
  .readiness-grid .ma-benefit-card {
    background: linear-gradient(160deg, rgba(26,26,46,.8), rgba(17,17,34,.6));
    border-color: rgba(255,255,255,.1);
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 2rem;
  }
  .readiness-grid .ma-benefit-card.primary {
    background: linear-gradient(160deg, rgba(0,229,160,.07), rgba(26,26,46,.8));
    border-color: rgba(0,229,160,.25);
  }
  .readiness-grid .ma-benefit-card h3 { font-size: 1.55rem; }
  .readiness-grid .ma-benefit-card p { color: rgba(255,255,255,.76); line-height: 1.6; }

  /* Split / proof section */
  .section-alt { background: var(--ma-surface-alt); border-block: 1px solid var(--ma-border); }
  .split-section { display: grid; grid-template-columns: .85fr 1.15fr; gap: 3rem; align-items: start; }
  .split-section h2 { font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3.6rem); }
  .split-section > div > p { font-size: 1.04rem; color: rgba(255,255,255,.78); }
  .proof-stack { display: grid; gap: 1rem; }
  .proof-item {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 52px 1fr;
    gap: 1rem;
    background: var(--ma-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--ma-border);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 1.35rem;
  }
  .proof-item b { font-family: var(--ma-font-mono); color: var(--ma-mint); }
  .proof-item p { grid-column: 2; margin-top: -.4rem; color: rgba(255,255,255,.72); }

  /* Flow strip */
  .flow-strip {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(5, 1fr);
    border: 1px solid var(--ma-border);
    border-radius: 16px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .flow-strip > div {
    padding: 1.5rem;
    background: var(--ma-surface);
    border-right: 1px solid var(--ma-border);
    min-height: 185px;
  }
  .flow-strip > div:last-child { border-right: 0; }
  .flow-strip span { font-family: var(--ma-font-mono); color: var(--ma-mint); font-size: .75rem; }
  .flow-strip strong { display: block; font-family: var(--ma-font-display); font-size: 1.35rem; margin: 2rem 0 .5rem; }
  .flow-strip p { color: rgba(255,255,255,.72); font-size: .92rem; }

  /* CTA breathing room */
  .command-centre .ma-cta { padding: 7rem 0 8rem; }

  @media (max-width: 960px) {
    .hero-layout, .split-section { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .ma-benefits-grid, .flow-strip { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .flow-strip > div { border-right: 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--ma-border); }
    .signal { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .signal strong { text-align: left; }
  }
</style>
